  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until browned on all sides.",
    "Add the smoked paprika, garlic-free seasoning, salt, and black pepper, and stir to combine.",
    "Add the chicken broth and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low and simmer for 1 1/2 hours.",
    "Stir in the chopped parsley.",
    "Serve hot.",
    "Garnish with additional parsley if desired.",
    "Ensure poultry is cooked to an internal temperature of 74°C / 165°F (juices run clear, no pink remaining) before serving."
